  "content": "[Intro]\n[Asus2/E]\n[E]\nMo-\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]li -\nna,\nwhere you goin' to?\nMo-\n[C#m]li -\n[B]na,\n[E]where you goin' to?\nShe's\n\n[Verse 1]\n[E]daughter to the mayor,\nMessin' with the sheriff,\nDrivin' in a blue car,\nShe don't see no red light. Mo-\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]li -\nna,\nwhere you goin' to?\nMo-\n[C#m]li -\n[B]na,\n[E]where you goin' to?\nShe's\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E]comin' in the mornin'\nLookin' a disaster,\nDrivin' in the prowl car,\nSpent the night in jail. Mo-\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]li -\nna,\nwhere you goin' to?\nMo-\n[C#m]li -\n[B]na,\n[E]where you goin' to?\n\n[Interlude]\n[E]\n[B]\n[A]\n[E]\n[E]\n[B]\n[A]\n[E]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[E]Sheriff gonna go far\nDrivin' to the state house,\nIf she makes a million,\nPapa can retire. Mo-\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]li -\nna,\nwhere you goin' to?\nMo-\n[C#m]li -\n[B]na,\n[E]where you goin' to?\nMo-\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]li -\nna,\nwhere you goin' to?\nMo-\n[C#m]li -\n[B]na,\n[E]where you goin' to?\n\n[Break]\n\n[Outro]\n[E]",
